---
description: Feature map protocol — read before touching source
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow `AGENTS.md § Feature map` (mandatory). Start at `features/README.md`, open only the feature
files your task needs (never read `features/*.md` in bulk), update the owning `features/<slug>.md` in
the same change, and end the PR description with a `Feature map:` line.
